Status: 🚧 API Contract (Frozen after approval)



Implementation: ❌ Not started



This contract defines how the backend reserves inventory for a specific product variant.



Inventory reservation is used to temporarily lock stock for checkout, order placement, payment processing, and order fulfillment workflows without immediately deducting physical inventory.



A reservation prevents overselling while allowing stock to be released if the order is cancelled or expires.



