Frozen Engineering Decisions

1. Aggregate media validation



Media validation evaluates the complete media aggregate (images, videos, variant media, metadata, ordering, and publish requirements) rather than validating individual files independently.



2. Shared media validation engine



All media-related operations—including Upload Image, Upload Video, Set Primary Image, Set Primary Video, Publish Product, Bulk Import, AI Product Generation, and Admin tools—must reuse this validation engine to ensure consistent media quality rules.



3. Publish-aware validation



validationMode = PUBLISH enforces all publish-blocking media requirements. At least one processed image and exactly one primary image are mandatory. Videos remain optional unless marketplace policy changes.



4. Metadata integrity



Validation confirms only metadata integrity and processing status. It never performs image optimization, transcoding, virus scanning, or storage operations; those are handled by dedicated media services.



5. Read-only and deterministic



The Validate Media API is side-effect free. It never uploads, deletes, reorders, or modifies media, and identical media aggregates always produce identical validation results.



